    <data key="d0">CloudHealth by VMware: Secure State. Manages Over 50M Assets from Billions of Events on AWS</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6EUknQqaV1w</data>
    <data key="d2">Handles billions of cloud provider security events daily across 50M+ monitored cloud resources.</data>
    <data key="d3">Security, Real-time Analytics, Graph Data Pipeline</data>
